    {
      "text": "the Lord bestows gift of the Holy Ghost on those who are confirmed in Church, D&C 20:43 (33:15; 35:6; 39:23; 49:14; 55:1; 68:25). Sidney Rigdon baptized by water, but they did not receive the Holy Ghost, D&C 35:5. after baptism, receive the Holy Ghost by laying on of hands, D&C 35:6 (55:1). elders ordained to preach reception of the Holy Spirit by laying on of hands, D&C 53:3. parents must teach children doctrine of gift of the Holy Ghost, D&C 68:25. those in celestial glory have received the Holy Spirit by laying on of hands, D&C 76:52. every soul who is baptized shall receive the Holy Ghost, D&C 84:64. the Holy Ghost shall be thy constant companion, D&C 121:46. spirits of dead are taught gift of the Holy Ghost by laying on of hands, D&C 138:33.",
